sequenceDiagram
  %% command: instance:deploy
  %% kind: instance.deploy
  %% status: migrated
  autonumber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant SW as Swamp
  participant N as AppProd Node<br/>Instance owner
  CLI->>GW: instance:deploy<br/>optional pinned commit
  GW->>GW: Hold the Instance<br/>record its admitted commit
  Note over GW: First host migration<br/>pin the serving commit
  GW->>SW: Start production-release<br/>private Operation input
  SW->>N: Verify target and source<br/>check room for the release
  SW->>N: Build in preparation<br/>apply deploy steps and seal
  SW->>N: Clone the sealed build
  SW->>N: Sleep preparation<br/>reclaim memory to swap
  SW->>N: Check candidate readiness
  SW->>N: Switch Instance Routes<br/>hand over Processes and Schedules
  SW->>N: Drain and freeze old live<br/>retain it for rollback
  SW->>N: Read live and old commits
  SW-->>GW: Verified release receipt<br/>Node, Instance, commit and digest
  GW-->>CLI: Record the result<br/>verified live and rollback commits
